    "prop-continuity": "Same bread piece, wooden bowl and stool in every pose. The bread piece remains depicted rather than vanishing or being consumed. This fixed-view ambient gesture does not spend food, simulate a measured bite or certify hidden finger anatomy.",
    "last-to-first-transition": "Frame7 lowers the bread to the same chest position as0, with continuous right-hand grip and left-hand bowl support. All eight poses and0/7 comparison reviewed. Live playback finishes once, holds7, then makes a distinct preloaded activity handoff. No seamless transition to a different activity is implied."
